      "content": "The ache to return to what was, and the desire for that sense of completion, is a deeply human part of loving someone so much. It is natural to feel stuck in that painful space between memories and reality. Please know that while you wish for that impossible return, there are people who can help you navigate this feeling of being trapped. Could you consider talking to a grief counselor who specializes in this kind of profound longing?",
      "source": "target",
